MultiFlexi Executor Docker helper package
=========================================

This package provides the Docker executor class for MultiFlexi. It requires
Docker Engine on the host and adds the ``multiflexi`` user to the ``docker``
group (when both exist).

Quick install path
------------------

1. Install Docker Engine and start the daemon::

     sudo apt-get install -y docker.io
     sudo systemctl enable --now docker

2. Install packages::

     sudo apt-get install -y multiflexi-executor multiflexi-executor-docker

3. Confirm group membership and restart the daemon::

     id multiflexi
     sudo systemctl restart multiflexi-executor
     sudo -u multiflexi docker info >/dev/null

4. Optional settings in ``/etc/multiflexi/multiflexi.env``::

     # MULTIFLEXI_DOCKER_NETWORK=mynet
     # MULTIFLEXI_DOCKER_PULL=always

5. Set runtemplate executor to ``Docker``; application needs ``ociimage``.

Full guide: multiflexi-doc-en ``source/integrations/docker-executor.rst``.
